        },
        {
            "title": "美股｜Twilio獲摩通上調目標價 股價午後升5.5% 年內累漲110%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜Twilio獲摩通上調目標價 股價午後升5.5% 年內累漲110%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜Twilio獲摩通上調目標價 股價午後升5.5% 年內累漲110%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">客戶互動平台Twilio（TWLO）周五午後股價升5.5%，因摩根大通上調其目標價，加上獲納入標普500指數後持續有機構資金流入，科技股亦從人工智能憂慮引發的跌勢中反彈。該股報289.97美元，年內累升110%，貼近52周高位。此前一天，人工智能及科技股因OpenAI收入報告而受壓，但跌勢短暫。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1-twilio%E7%8D%B2%E6%91%A9%E9%80%9A%E4%B8%8A%E8%AA%BF%E7%9B%AE%E6%A8%99%E5%83%B9-%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%E5%8D%88%E5%BE%8C%E5%8D%875-5-%E5%B9%B4%E5%85%A7%E7%B4%AF%E6%BC%B2110-020026351.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-10 10:08:30",
